<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/18/eng@/~cl_1__subsec_1> <https://schema.org/text> "This Act may be cited as the Anti-Trafficking in Persons and Anti-Smuggling of Migrants (Amendment) Act 2015."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/18/eng@> .
